[{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"比的前项除以后项，得到的叫什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"比值"},{"key":"B","text":"前项"},{"key":"C","text":"后项"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"前项÷后项＝比值。","id":"cnm_p185_q1","topicId":"cnm_p185"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"6：8 的比值是多少？","answer":"3/4","explanation":"6÷8＝3/4。","verify":"6/8","id":"cnm_p185_q2","topicId":"cnm_p185"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"12：4 的比值是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"12÷4＝3。","verify":"12/4","id":"cnm_p185_q3","topicId":"cnm_p185"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一班有男生 20 人、女生 15 人。男生人数与全班人数的比化成最简整数比后，前项是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"全班 35 人，20：35＝4：7，前项是 4。","verify":"20/5","id":"cnm_p185_q4","topicId":"cnm_p185"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"比 12：8 化成最简整数比后，前项是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"12：8＝3：2，前项是 3。","verify":"12/4","id":"cnm_p186_q1","topicId":"cnm_p186"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"比 15：10 化成最简整数比后，前项是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"15：10＝3：2，前项是 3。","verify":"15/5","id":"cnm_p186_q2","topicId":"cnm_p186"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"比 24：18 化成最简整数比后，后项是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"24：18＝4：3，后项是 3。","verify":"18/6","id":"cnm_p186_q3","topicId":"cnm_p186"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"把 0.5：2 化成最简整数比后，前项是多少？","answer":"1","explanation":"两项同乘 2 得 1：4，前项是 1。","verify":"1","id":"cnm_p186_q4","topicId":"cnm_p186"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"把 30 按 2：3 分成两份，与 2 对应的那一份是多少？","answer":"12","explanation":"总份数 5，每份 6，2 份是 12。","verify":"30/(2+3)*2","id":"cnm_p187_q1","topicId":"cnm_p187"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"把 40 按 1：3 分成两份，与 1 对应的那一份是多少？","answer":"10","explanation":"总份数 4，每份 10。","verify":"40/(1+3)*1","id":"cnm_p187_q2","topicId":"cnm_p187"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"56 本本子按 3：4 分给两个班。分得多的那个班分到多少本？","answer":"32","explanation":"总份数 7，每份 8，4 份是 32。","verify":"56/(3+4)*4","id":"cnm_p187_q3","topicId":"cnm_p187"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"90 元按 2：3：4 分成三份。最多的一份是多少元？","answer":"40","explanation":"总份数 9，每份 10，4 份是 40。","verify":"90/(2+3+4)*4","id":"cnm_p187_q4","topicId":"cnm_p187"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"比例的两项外项之积与两项内项之积怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"等于两项内项之积"},{"key":"B","text":"一定比内项之积大"},{"key":"C","text":"没有固定关系"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"这是比例的基本性质。","id":"cnm_p210_q1","topicId":"cnm_p210"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"在比例 2：3＝4：6 中，两个外项的积是多少？","answer":"12","explanation":"外项是 2 和 6，2×6＝12。","verify":"2*6","id":"cnm_p210_q2","topicId":"cnm_p210"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一组中的两个比可以组成比例？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"3：5 和 6：9"},{"key":"B","text":"6：3 和 8：4"},{"key":"C","text":"2：5 和 4：9"},{"key":"D","text":"1：4 和 2：9"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"6：3＝2，8：4＝2，比值相等，可以组成比例。","id":"cnm_p210_q3","topicId":"cnm_p210"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"已知 6：9 和 8：12 的比值相等。根据比例的基本性质，6×12 等于多少？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"9×8"},{"key":"B","text":"6×8"},{"key":"C","text":"9×12"},{"key":"D","text":"6＋12"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"组成比例 6：9＝8：12 后，外项积等于内项积：6×12＝9×8。","id":"cnm_p210_q4","topicId":"cnm_p210"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"2：3＝8：x。x 是多少？","answer":"12","explanation":"外项积等于内项积：2x＝24，x＝12。","verify":"8*3/2","id":"cnm_p211_q1","topicId":"cnm_p211"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"4：5＝x：20。x 是多少？","answer":"16","explanation":"4×20＝5x，x＝16。","verify":"4*20/5","id":"cnm_p211_q2","topicId":"cnm_p211"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"6：x＝2：5。x 是多少？","answer":"15","explanation":"6×5＝2x，x＝15。","verify":"6*5/2","id":"cnm_p211_q3","topicId":"cnm_p211"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"如果 x：12＝5：8，x 是多少？（用小数作答）","answer":"7.5","explanation":"8x＝12×5＝60，x＝7.5。","verify":"12*5/8","id":"cnm_p211_q4","topicId":"cnm_p211"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"比例尺是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"图上距离与实际距离的比"},{"key":"B","text":"图上距离加上实际距离"},{"key":"C","text":"只表示方向"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"图上距离：实际距离＝比例尺。","id":"cnm_p212_q1","topicId":"cnm_p212"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"图上距离 4 厘米，比例尺是 1：100。实际距离是多少厘米？","answer":"400","explanation":"实际＝图上×100＝400。","verify":"4*100","id":"cnm_p212_q2","topicId":"cnm_p212"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"实际距离 800 厘米，图上距离 4 厘米。这幅图的比例尺是 1：几？","answer":"200","explanation":"800÷4＝200，比例尺是 1：200。","verify":"800/4","id":"cnm_p212_q3","topicId":"cnm_p212"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一幅地图的比例尺是 1：50000。图上 3 厘米表示实际多少千米？（用小数作答）","answer":"1.5","explanation":"实际 3×50000＝150000 厘米＝1.5 千米。","verify":"3*50000/100000","id":"cnm_p212_q4","topicId":"cnm_p212"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"成正比例的两种量有什么特征？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"比值一定"},{"key":"B","text":"乘积一定"},{"key":"C","text":"和一定"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"速度一定时，路程和时间成正比例。","id":"cnm_p213_q1","topicId":"cnm_p213"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"速度一定，3 时行 180 千米。6 时行多少千米？","answer":"360","explanation":"路程与时间成正比例，时间变为 2 倍，路程也变为 2 倍：360 千米。","verify":"180/3*6","id":"cnm_p213_q2","topicId":"cnm_p213"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"抽水机的工作效率一定，它 1 小时抽水 12 吨。5 小时抽水多少吨？","answer":"60","explanation":"抽水量与时间成正比例：12×5＝60。","verify":"12*5","id":"cnm_p213_q3","topicId":"cnm_p213"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"下表中 x 与 y 是否成正比例？x：2、4、6；y：6、12、18。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"成正比例，因为 y÷x 都等于 3"},{"key":"B","text":"不成正比例，因为 y 在变"},{"key":"C","text":"成反比例，因为乘积一定"},{"key":"D","text":"无法判断"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"6÷2＝12÷4＝18÷6＝3，比值一定，成正比例。","id":"cnm_p213_q4","topicId":"cnm_p213"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"成反比例的两种量有什么特征？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"乘积一定"},{"key":"B","text":"比值一定"},{"key":"C","text":"差一定"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"总价一定时，单价和数量成反比例。","id":"cnm_p214_q1","topicId":"cnm_p214"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"总价一定，单价 4 元时能买 6 个。单价 3 元时能买几个？","answer":"8","explanation":"4×6＝3×x，x＝8。","verify":"4*6/3","id":"cnm_p214_q2","topicId":"cnm_p214"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"修一段路，每天修 8 米要 6 天。每天修 12 米，要几天？","answer":"4","explanation":"工作总量一定，8×6＝12×x，x＝4。","verify":"8*6/12","id":"cnm_p214_q3","topicId":"cnm_p214"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一项工程，甲单独做 10 天完成。乙的工效是甲的 2 倍。乙单独做要几天？","answer":"5","explanation":"工作总量一定，工效变为 2 倍，时间变为 1/2：10÷2＝5。","verify":"10/2","id":"cnm_p214_q4","topicId":"cnm_p214"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"3 本同样的笔记本 12 元，5 本多少元？","answer":"20","explanation":"单价 4 元，5 本 20 元。也可以用正比例：12÷3×5＝20。","verify":"12/3*5","id":"cnm_p215_q1","topicId":"cnm_p215"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"2 小时行 90 千米，同样的速度 4 小时行多少千米？","answer":"180","explanation":"90÷2×4＝180。","verify":"90/2*4","id":"cnm_p215_q2","topicId":"cnm_p215"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"用 6 台同样的机器 4 小时完成的工作，改用 8 台要几小时？","answer":"3","explanation":"工作总量一定，机器台数与时间成反比例：6×4÷8＝3。","verify":"6*4/8","id":"cnm_p215_q3","topicId":"cnm_p215"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"numeric","prompt":"一项工程计划 5 天完成，每天修 40 米。如果每天修 50 米，几天能完成？","answer":"4","explanation":"总量 5×40＝200 米，200÷50＝4 天。","verify":"5*40/50","id":"cnm_p215_q4","topicId":"cnm_p215"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"把边长 2 厘米的正方形按 1:3 放大，新正方形边长是多少厘米？","answer":"6","explanation":"边长变为原来的 3 倍：2×3＝6。","verify":"2*3","id":"cnm_p249_q1","topicId":"cnm_p249"},{"difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"一条线段长 12 厘米，按 2:1 缩小后长多少厘米？","answer":"6","explanation":"缩小到原来的 1/2：12÷2＝6。","verify":"12/2","id":"cnm_p249_q2","topicId":"cnm_p249"},{"difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"长方形长 5 厘米、宽 3 厘米，按 1:2 放大后，长是多少厘米？","answer":"10","explanation":"长变为 5×2＝10。","verify":"5*2","id":"cnm_p249_q3","topicId":"cnm_p249"},{"difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"把一个三角形按比放大后，哪一项一定不变？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"各边的长度"},{"key":"B","text":"各角的度数"},{"key":"C","text":"面积"},{"key":"D","text":"周长"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"放大或缩小后形状不变，对应角相等；边长、周长、面积都会变。","id":"cnm_p249_q4","topicId":"cnm_p249"}]
